;    1: TDecorate(count=254, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おきて, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=9, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おきて, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=564, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=505, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Isn't there some way you could help us?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If things go on like this, we'll have no choice but to die together..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know full well that the settlement's <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE> means you can't help us directly. 
{PAUSE ""}
So―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You know the Arata settlement's slogan, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
'One for all, and all for one.'"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Asking me to break the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> means you, </STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="1">, breaking the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Read by that slogan, it's one person causing trouble for everyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Think it over again."</STYLE><PG>
"But...!
{PAUSE ""}
　But in the past, the Arata settlement has made the sacrifices it needed to protect its own...!
{PAUSE ""}
　So―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So you'd kill two children?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Besides, times aren't like that anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The Arata settlement may be cut off, but it doesn't live in defiance of the outside world."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, </STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="1">. I can't be of any use to you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"With financial help and moving to Arata both forbidden now, all I can do..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"...is just listen to what you have to say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I can't break the settlement's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
"I understand... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sorry you came all this way for me. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE>."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------